<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ALOX5–HFpEF 课题研究总结</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

:root {
  --bg: #0c0e12;
  --bg2: #13161c;
  --bg3: #1a1e27;
  --border: #252a36;
  --border2: #2e3547;
  --text: #dde2ec;
  --text2: #8e97ae;
  --text3: #5c6478;
  --blue: #4f8ef7;
  --blue-dim: #1e3a6e;
  --blue-glow: rgba(79,142,247,0.12);
  --purple: #9b7ff4;
  --purple-dim: #2d1f5e;
  --purple-glow: rgba(155,127,244,0.12);
  --coral: #f07060;
  --coral-dim: #5a1f18;
  --coral-glow: rgba(240,112,96,0.12);
  --amber: #e8a83a;
  --amber-dim: #4a2f08;
  --amber-glow: rgba(232,168,58,0.12);
  --teal: #3abfa8;
  --teal-dim: #0d3d35;
  --teal-glow: rgba(58,191,168,0.12);
  --green: #5cd27a;
}

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

/* ── Noise texture overlay ── */
body::before {
  content: '';
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.03'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
  opacity: .4;
}

/* ── Layout ── */
.wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 32px 100px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

/* ── Header ── */
.masthead {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2);
  padding-bottom: 36px; margin-bottom: 52px;
}
.masthead-label {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.label-tag {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue-dim);
  border: 1px solid rgba(79,142,247,.3);
  padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap;
}
.label-tag.amber { color: var(--amber); background: var(--amber-dim); border-color: rgba(232,168,58,.3); }
.masthead-title h1 {
  font-family: 'EB Garamond', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
  font-size: 34px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.25;
  color: #fff; letter-spacing: -.01em;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.masthead-title .subtitle {
  font-size: 14px; color: var(--text2); font-style: italic;
}

/* ── Section headings ── */
.section { margin-bottom: 56px; }
.section-header {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.sec-num {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .1em;
  flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;
}
.sec-title {
  font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: #fff;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 6px; flex: 1;
}
.sec-title span { color: var(--blue); }

/* ── Hypothesis card ── */
.hypo-card {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border2);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 28px 32px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.hypo-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, var(--blue-glow), transparent 60%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hypo-card .card-label {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.hypo-card p {
  font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: #eef;
  font-style: italic;
}

/* ── Sentence blocks ── */
.sentence-block {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.sb-header {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 6px 1fr;
}
.sb-accent { }
.sb-title-row {
  padding: 14px 20px;
  background: var(--bg2);
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;
}
.sb-num {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); flex-shrink: 0;
}
.sb-sentence {
  font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 500; color: #e8ecf8;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.sb-body {
  padding: 18px 20px 20px 38px;
  background: var(--bg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
}
.sb-col-title {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.sb-col ul { list-style: none; }
.sb-col ul li {
  padding: 4px 0;
  padding-left: 14px;
  position: relative;
  font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.55;
}
.sb-col ul li::before {
  content: '·';
  position: absolute; left: 0;
  color: var(--text3);
}
.sb-col ul li strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
.sb-col ul li em { color: var(--teal); font-style: normal; }

/* Color accents per block */
.blue .sb-accent { background: var(--blue); }
.blue .sb-title-row { border-left: 3px solid var(--blue); }
.blue .sb-col-title { color: var(--blue); }
.purple .sb-accent { background: var(--purple); }
.purple .sb-title-row { border-left: 3px solid var(--purple); }
.purple .sb-col-title { color: var(--purple); }
.coral .sb-accent { background: var(--coral); }
.coral .sb-title-row { border-left: 3px solid var(--coral); }
.coral .sb-col-title { color: var(--coral); }
.amber .sb-accent { background: var(--amber); }
.amber .sb-title-row { border-left: 3px solid var(--amber); }
.amber .sb-col-title { color: var(--amber); }
.teal .sb-accent { background: var(--teal); }
.teal .sb-title-row { border-left: 3px solid var(--teal); }
.teal .sb-col-title { color: var(--teal); }

/* ── Phase pipeline ── */
.pipeline {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 2px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
  border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;
}
.phase-card {
  padding: 20px 16px;
  background: var(--bg2);
  position: relative;
}
.phase-card::after {
  content: '→';
  position: absolute; right: -10px; top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  color: var(--text3); font-size: 16px; z-index: 2;
}
.phase-card:last-child::after { display: none; }
.phase-num {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.phase-name {
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.3;
}
.phase-desc { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.5; }
.phase-card.p1 { border-top: 2px solid var(--blue); }
.phase-card.p1 .phase-num { color: var(--blue); }
.phase-card.p2 { border-top: 2px solid var(--purple); }
.phase-card.p2 .phase-num { color: var(--purple); }
.phase-card.p3 { border-top: 2px solid var(--coral); }
.phase-card.p3 .phase-num { color: var(--coral); }
.phase-card.p4 { border-top: 2px solid var(--amber); }
.phase-card.p4 .phase-num { color: var(--amber); }

/* ── Contradiction box ── */
.contradiction {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border2);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 22px 26px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.contradiction .c-label {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--coral); margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.contradiction .c-q {
  font-size: 14.5px; color: #f8c0b8; margin-bottom: 14px;
  font-style: italic;
}
.contra-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px;
}
.contra-item {
  background: var(--bg3); border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 14px 16px;
}
.contra-item .ci-label {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--text3);
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.contra-item p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.6; }
.contra-item p strong { color: var(--text); }

/* ── Plan table ── */
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
th {
  padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text3);
  background: var(--bg2);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2);
}
td {
  padding: 11px 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text2); vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.6;
}
tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
td strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
.priority-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.p-now { background: rgba(92,210,122,.12); color: var(--green); border: 1px solid rgba(92,210,122,.25); }
.p-q2 { background: var(--blue-dim); color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid rgba(79,142,247,.25); }
.p-q3 { background: var(--purple-dim); color: var(--purple); border: 1px solid rgba(155,127,244,.25); }
.p-q4 { background: var(--amber-dim); color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid rgba(232,168,58,.25); }

/* ── Mini tags ── */
.mini-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .05em;
  padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; margin: 1px 2px 1px 0;
}
.t-blue { background: var(--blue-dim); color: var(--blue); }
.t-coral { background: var(--coral-dim); color: var(--coral); }
.t-amber { background: var(--amber-dim); color: var(--amber); }
.t-teal { background: var(--teal-dim); color: var(--teal); }
.t-purple { background: var(--purple-dim); color: var(--purple); }

/* ── Callout ── */
.callout {
  background: var(--bg2); border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 18px 22px; margin-top: 20px;
  display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
}
.callout-icon { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 1px; }
.callout p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.65; }
.callout p strong { color: var(--text); }

/* ── Divider ── */
.divider {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
  margin: 48px 0;
}
.divider::before, .divider::after {
  content: ''; flex: 1;
  height: 1px; background: var(--border);
}
.divider span {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: .1em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ── Evidence level ── */
.ev { display: inline-flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center; }
.ev-dot {
  width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--border2);
}
.ev-dot.fill { background: var(--green); }

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .sb-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .pipeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .contra-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<!-- ══ MASTHEAD ══ -->
<div class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-label">
    <div class="label-tag">课题总结</div>
    <div class="label-tag amber">Edison × 自有数据</div>
  </div>
  <div class="masthead-title">
    <h1>ALOX5 作为 HFpEF 衰老驱动<br>炎症放大器的研究总结</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">核心假说 · 逐句拆解 · 文献支撑 · 研究计划 · 2025</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ SECTION 1: 四阶段框架速览 ══ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="sec-num">01 /</span>
    <div class="sec-title">病生理框架：<span>四阶段级联</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pipeline">
    <div class="phase-card p1">
      <div class="phase-num">阶段一</div>
      <div class="phase-name">代谢病因</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">肥胖/IR/高血压 → cPLA2激活 → ↑AA释放 → ALOX5底物预装载</div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-card p2">
      <div class="phase-num">阶段二</div>
      <div class="phase-name">炎症衰老</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">衰老SASP + 线粒体ROS → ALOX5通路诱导 → "Oxylipin SASP"放大器</div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-card p3">
      <div class="phase-num">阶段三</div>
      <div class="phase-name">炎症放大</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">LTB4/5-HETE → 纤维化臂 + 内皮臂 · 跨细胞白三烯放大网络</div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-card p4">
      <div class="phase-num">阶段四</div>
      <div class="phase-name">代谢重编程</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">NF-κB→线粒体损伤→FAO↓/糖酵解↑ → 膜AA释放↑ → 反馈阶段一</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ SECTION 2: 核心假说逐句拆解 ══ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="sec-num">02 /</span>
    <div class="sec-title">核心假说：<span>逐句拆解与文献支撑</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="hypo-card">
    <div class="card-label">Core Hypothesis · 完整版</div>
    <p>ALOX5 不是经典巨噬细胞白三烯通路的心脏版，而是一个<strong>衰老驱动的炎症放大器</strong>，在代谢应激（肥胖/IR/高血压）触发 cPLA2/iPLA2 激活、花生四烯酸（AA）底物超载之后，由心脏驻留非免疫细胞（心肌细胞、内皮细胞、成纤维细胞）中的衰老程序和线粒体氧化应激所诱导，通过 LTB4–BLT1 轴向成纤维细胞和内皮细胞发出炎性级联信号，桥接心肌结构重塑（纤维化/僵硬）与能量代谢失败（FAO↓/线粒体损伤），并经代谢重编程的膜AA释放形成正反馈闭环——这一机制在单细胞转录组学中不可见，但可通过 5-LOX 模块评分、空间蛋白质组和 ALOX5-KO 表型救援所揭示。</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 句1 -->
  <div class="sentence-block blue">
    <div class="sb-header">
      <div class="sb-accent"></div>
      <div class="sb-title-row">
        <span class="sb-num">句①</span>
        <div class="sb-sentence">ALOX5 不是经典巨噬细胞白三烯通路的心脏版</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sb-body">
      <div class="sb-col">
        <div class="sb-col-title">逻辑支撑</div>
        <ul>
          <li>经典白三烯生物学以中性粒/巨噬细胞为高产核心，BLT1驱动趋化和炎症扩增是主范式</li>
          <li>你的 scRNA-seq 显示：HFpEF 小鼠<strong>巨噬细胞/单核细胞中 ALOX5 无显著上调</strong></li>
          <li>单凭巨噬细胞范式无法解释 KO 表型救援</li>
          <li>驻留心脏细胞（CM/EC）ALOX5 的功能模式完全不同：<em>应激-反应程序</em>而非趋化程序</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="sb-col">
        <div class="sb-col-title">文献支撑（Edison Q1/Q4）</div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Liu & Ai 2025</strong>（LOX综述）：心肌细胞在缺氧/ROS下上调 ALOX5/5-LO 活性，5-LO 抑制减少氧化应激</li>
          <li><strong>心肌细胞</strong>是最强证据支持的非免疫 ALOX5 来源（[1.1],[8.1]）</li>
          <li>内皮细胞缺乏内在 5-LO 表达，但表达 LTA4 水解酶，<em>作为跨细胞转化放大层</em></li>
          <li>scRNA 漏检原因：低丰度转录本 + 解离偏倚 + 空间限制（见句⑤）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 句2 -->
  <div class="sentence-block purple">
    <div class="sb-header">
      <div class="sb-accent"></div>
      <div class="sb-title-row">
        <span class="sb-num">句②</span>
        <div class="sb-sentence">而是一个衰老驱动的炎症放大器</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sb-body">
      <div class="sb-col">
        <div class="sb-col-title">逻辑支撑</div>
        <ul>
          <li>ALOX5 不是 SASP 组分（初始分泌因子），而是 <strong>SASP 放大器</strong>：衰老诱导 ALOX5 表达，ALOX5 产生白三烯反馈促进氧化损伤和继发衰老</li>
          <li>机制：DNA损伤/端粒缩短 → p38-MAPK/NF-κB → ALOX5 转录上调 + PLA2 激活 → 白三烯/5-HETE → ROS → 加速 SASP 分泌</li>
          <li>衰老驱动是阶段二到阶段三的桥梁，解释为何代谢应激之后才出现持续性炎症</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="sb-col">
        <div class="sb-col-title">文献支撑（Edison Q1/Q7）</div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Wiley et al., Cell Metabolism 2021</strong>：衰老细胞（含 MiDAS）转录上调白三烯合成基因包括 <em>ALOX5、ALOX5AP、LTC4S、LTA4H</em></li>
          <li><strong>Wiley & Campisi, Nature Metabolism 2021</strong>：PLA2 位于 ALOX5/COX2 上游，构成"Oxylipin SASP"脂质介质臂</li>
          <li>LTC4 作为白三烯 C4 可介导 RAS 诱导的氧化 DNA 损伤（NOX4 核转位），形成衰老自强化环路（[4.1]）</li>
          <li>ALOX5 经 p53 通路与衰老相连（[4.1]）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 句3 -->
  <div class="sentence-block blue">
    <div class="sb-header">
      <div class="sb-accent"></div>
      <div class="sb-title-row">
        <span class="sb-num">句③</span>
        <div class="sb-sentence">在代谢应激触发 cPLA2/iPLA2 激活、AA 底物超载之后</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sb-body">
      <div class="sb-col">
        <div class="sb-col-title">逻辑支撑（阶段一触发器）</div>
        <ul>
          <li>代谢应激（肥胖→异位脂肪/高血压→神经激素/IR→FOXO1解抑制）通过三条路径增加心脏 AA</li>
          <li><strong>cPLA2α</strong>：AA偏好型，MAPK/ERK磷酸化激活，转位至内质网/脂滴膜释放AA</li>
          <li><strong>iPLA2β</strong>：Ca²⁺非依赖，磷脂重塑和线粒体来源AA</li>
          <li>IR → FOXO1 解抑制 → 直接增强 5-LO/LTB4 信号轴（绕过胰岛素对该通路的抑制）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="sb-col">
